1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
'Anime Lovers' Wishes You a Good Watch!
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,350
Here I go, Masao!

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:07,610
A hopeless situation for Nankatsu!

4
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,940
Go, Skylab...!

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:10,730
We got them!

6
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:11,900
This is a turn!

7
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:15,540
Ah!

8
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,370
They couldn't jump!

9
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:17,390
It broke!

10
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:20,910
The Tachibana twins couldn't pull off the Skylab Hurricane!

11
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,330
It really did a number on them, huh...

12
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,370
Damn it!

13
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:25,830
It looks like both of them cramped up in their legs.

14
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,830
Looks like we're safe for now.

15
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:28,810
Yeah.

16
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:31,210
Seems Tsubasa was right after all

17
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,610
about them taking massive damage to their legs.

18
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:36,080
Here it comes!

19
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,490
Nankatsu's captain Tsubasa has returned

20
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,890
after a brief withdrawal from the fray!

21
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:43,690
So you returned, Tsubasa.

22
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,570
Tsubasa!

23
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,060
Is your shoulder okay?

24
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,440
Yeah, no problem.

25
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,100
Sorry, Tsubasa.

26
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,860
We messed up and let them tie the score.

27
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:54,070
If they caught up, the only thing
left to do is to move again.

28
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:57,820
Let's show them once more the offense
we had at the beginning of the first half!

29
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,330
Yeah!

30
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:02,770
We'll have to defend until our legs heal.

31
00:01:02,770 --> 00:01:03,580
Yes.

32
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:07,080
At best, we can use the Skylab Hurricane one more time.

33
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:07,080
Skylab Hurricane

34
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,000
Tsubasa!

35
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,170
I trust you!

36
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,650
I can't go in front of the goal where physical play is intense,

37
00:01:12,650 --> 00:01:14,880
because I have to avoid contact.

38
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:17,050
I can't use Kisugi or Taki either.

39
00:01:17,050 --> 00:01:20,180
Then, there's only one chance for me to score.

40
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,260
What?!

41
00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:30,820
The only way is the Drive Shot!

42
00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:30,820
Drive Shot

43
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:33,670
After seeing Hanawa's solid defense, Tsubasa

44
00:01:33,670 --> 00:01:36,530
immediately got into position for a decisive long shot!

45
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:37,890
It's coming, cameraman!

46
00:01:37,890 --> 00:01:40,580
Here is Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot!

47
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:41,810
Make it count, Tsubasa!

48
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:42,830
Your Drive Shot!

49
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:44,410
I know you can do it!

50
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:45,290
Tsubasa!

51
00:01:45,290 --> 00:01:46,910
Go!

52
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,460
Drive...

53
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:55,010
Shot!

54
00:01:55,010 --> 00:02:15,010
You can send your thoughts about the subtitles to our Instagram account.
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

55
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,970
Ai! Ai! Ai!

56
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,970
Love! Love! Love!

57
00:02:00,890 --> 00:02:03,560
Ai! Ai! Ai!

58
00:02:00,890 --> 00:02:03,560
Love! Love! Love!

59
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:07,190
Ai! Ai! Ai!

60
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:07,190
Love! Love! Love!

61
00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:16,900
moeru you ni hitori demo

62
00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:16,900
I keep lying to myself.

63
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:23,160
ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete

64
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:23,160
I say I can live alone, even if loneliness burns me.

65
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:29,040
unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni

66
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:29,040
Even though you knew how fragile my pride was.

67
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:35,630
kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni

68
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:35,630
Tonight, even my heart is shattered.

69
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:39,630
kimi no koe sagasu

70
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:39,630
I hate being helpless.

71
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:44,140
kono yowasa ga nikui yo

72
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:44,140
The longing for your voice.

73
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:49,690
ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

74
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:49,690
"I have to go back right away!"

75
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:51,270
baka darou?

76
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:51,270
I'm stupid, aren't I?

77
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:52,480
ai

78
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:52,480
Love!

79
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,980
kizudarake no ai wo shinjite

80
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,980
Believing in my wounded love...

81
00:02:55,980 --> 00:03:05,870
nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete

82
00:02:55,980 --> 00:03:05,870
I will turn these fallen tears into strength.

83
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,700
ai

84
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,700
Love!

85
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:10,500
kizudarake no ai da to shite mo

86
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:10,500
Even though it's a wounded love,

87
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:14,500
bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru

88
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:14,500
it illuminates my world.

89
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:20,760
kono ai mo ichido taritomo

90
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:20,760
Even for a moment,

91
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:23,550
hanasanai

92
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:23,550
I won't let this love go!

93
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:30,230
EPISODE 39:
NANKATSU VS. HANAWA - THE CONCLUSION!

94
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:26,720
Go!

95
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,430
Drive...

96
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:31,480
Shot!

97
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:34,980
Tsubasa gives it his all and shoots!

98
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:38,230
It passes through Hanawa's tight defensive line!

99
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,490
The players can barely react!

100
00:03:42,220 --> 00:03:45,660
With the spin move on the ball, his shot descends towards the goal!

101
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:47,950
Now that's what I call a finishing shot!

102
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:50,890
This is Tsubasa's Drive Shot,

103
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:53,830
which he also attempted in his first match against Azumaichi MS.

104
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:53,830
Drive Shot

105
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:56,540
The goalkeeper can't react!

106
00:03:57,250 --> 00:03:59,100
Oh no, it hit the post!

107
00:03:59,100 --> 00:04:00,880
No goal!

108
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:01,730
That was close...

109
00:04:01,730 --> 00:04:03,840
He was almost there.

110
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,940
The ball bounced off the goal line.

111
00:04:07,510 --> 00:04:09,550
I failed once again...

112
00:04:09,550 --> 00:04:11,520
I was sure it would go in this time.

113
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:13,840
We got lucky this time.

114
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:16,180
The shot he used in the Azumaichi match.

115
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:18,270
We have to watch out for this.

116
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:21,040
That was close, Tsubasa.

117
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,780
Yeah.

118
00:04:22,530 --> 00:04:26,570
Oh no! Because of this shot, my shoulder and leg...

119
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:29,610
In the first game, the ball hit the post and went in...

120
00:04:29,610 --> 00:04:31,380
And now it hit the post.

121
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:33,580
He's almost perfected his Drive Shot.

122
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:33,580
Drive Shot

123
00:04:34,790 --> 00:04:36,330
Maybe it was because of his shoulder,

124
00:04:36,330 --> 00:04:40,250
but when he didn't kick through the ball,
his center of gravity shifted slightly to the left,

125
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:42,630
and the ball also curved to the left.

126
00:04:42,670 --> 00:04:46,260
If not for that, it would definitely have been a goal.

127
00:04:46,850 --> 00:04:48,140
I see.

128
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:50,970
You shoot by giving it a bit of spin.

129
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:54,100
Tsubasa's long shot didn't result in a goal either.

130
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:56,980
The game continues in a deadlock.

131
00:04:56,980 --> 00:05:00,830
The fourth day of the tournament, the third match
between Hanawa and Nankatsu.

132
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:04,500
25 minutes have passed in the second half, and the score is 2-2!

133
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:06,900
With Hanawa prioritizing defense,

134
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:09,340
can we assume they're aiming for penalty kicks?

135
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:12,620
Nankatsu continued to attack,
but no scoring chances appeared.

136
00:05:13,150 --> 00:05:14,360
What should we do?

137
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,540
Time is running out...

138
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,340
If things continue like this, we can't raise the score.

139
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:21,550
No matter what, before the Tachibana Twins' legs

140
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:23,760
recover, we have to score a goal.

141
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:26,150
My injured shoulder and leg hurt, but

142
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:28,550
should I try my Drive Shot one more time?

143
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:28,550
Drive Shot

144
00:05:28,550 --> 00:05:30,300
Or...

145
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:34,560
Whatever, I have to do something.

146
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,890
Only 5 minutes left...

147
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:38,310
We have to do it now.

148
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:39,190
Yes!

149
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:46,450
Hanawa's Tachibana Twins stopped marking Kisugi
and Taki and stole the ball.

150
00:05:46,450 --> 00:05:48,490
No way! They anticipated us!

151
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:50,870
The Tachibana Twins are ready for battle!

152
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:53,620
After their first attempt in the second half failed,

153
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:55,870
are they going to try the Skylab Hurricane once more?!

154
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:55,870
Skylab Hurricane

155
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,570
Are your legs okay?

156
00:05:57,570 --> 00:05:59,170
Let's go after them!

157
00:05:59,170 --> 00:06:02,670
Hanawa's back line is also pushing forward
and attacking as a unit!

158
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:04,260
Pull back, everyone!

159
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:09,260
When those two enter the penalty area,
whoever gets the ball should send it there!

160
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,600
Daimaru!

161
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,930
Takasugi, we're going up!

162
00:06:13,930 --> 00:06:16,460
We have no choice but to counter the height.

163
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:17,140
Okay!

164
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:19,020
No matter what, we'll stop them.

165
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:22,980
Daimaru!

166
00:06:26,170 --> 00:06:29,140
Another low pass!

167
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,190
Oh no!

168
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,370
From below?!

169
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,450
Let's go!

170
00:06:35,130 --> 00:06:41,710
This is our final Skylab Hurricane!

171
00:06:35,130 --> 00:06:41,710
Skylab Hurricane

172
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:43,840
Alright! Come on, Tachibana Twins!

173
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,460
Go!

174
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:50,050
They both jumped for the ball at the same time.

175
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:50,970
Tsubasa!

176
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:55,400
Ahh, jumping alone, Tsubasa isn't fast enough.

177
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,810
He can't reach!

178
00:06:56,810 --> 00:06:58,310
Alright, I'll handle it!

179
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,230
No, you won't!

180
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:00,440
What!?

181
00:07:02,140 --> 00:07:04,910
Tsubasa cleared the ball with a double jump.

182
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:08,840
After taking a second step,
he breaks the low Skylab Hurricane!

183
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:08,840
Skylab Hurricane

184
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,740
You did it, Tsubasa!

185
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:14,650
However, Hanawa recovers the light ball!

186
00:07:14,650 --> 00:07:17,080
Tamai! Toss the ball here!

187
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:19,830
But you can't use the Skylab Hurricane...

188
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:19,830
Skylab Hurricane

189
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:21,170
Whatever, just pass it to me!

190
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:23,540
The ball was sent to Masao.

191
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,210
But now he can't use the aerial technique.

192
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:28,710
Come on, Kazuo!

193
00:07:28,710 --> 00:07:30,840
Are we doing it, Masao nii-chan?

194
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:34,680
We've worked so hard for our goal of defeating Nankatsu...

195
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,760
We have one more special move!

196
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:37,600
Kazuo!

197
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:41,060
They still have something up their sleeve?

198
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:44,180
Masao lofted the ball into the air.

199
00:07:44,180 --> 00:07:46,540
Kazuo is sprinting!

200
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:48,440
What is this?!

201
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:51,300
We are Japan's number one twin duo!

202
00:07:51,300 --> 00:07:54,070
To prove it, we created this synchronized move!

203
00:07:56,330 --> 00:07:57,830
T-This...

204
00:07:57,830 --> 00:08:00,450
Twin Shot!

205
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:06,840
The Tachibana Twins took a shot together!

206
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,140
There's only one ball...

207
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:09,520
The ball is my friend!

208
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,200
Even if it hits my face, I don't care! Come on...

209
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:13,930
Hit me, please!

210
00:08:13,930 --> 00:08:14,800
Morisaki!

211
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:18,680
The ball hit Morisaki's shoulder.

212
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:23,140
Although it changed direction, it's still heading towards the goal!

213
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:23,770
Alright!

214
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:28,220
Damn it! If it goes in, we're finished!

215
00:08:32,290 --> 00:08:35,230
He clears it with his face!

216
00:08:35,230 --> 00:08:37,070
A perfect move from Ishizaki!

217
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:40,450
Yeah! Show them the monkey's timing, Ishizaki!

218
00:08:42,370 --> 00:08:43,210
Ishizaki!

219
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:46,430
The ball returned to play and reached Tsubasa.

220
00:08:46,430 --> 00:08:47,460
Ishizaki...

221
00:08:47,460 --> 00:08:49,680
I'm fine.

222
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,460
Forget about me, go and attack!

223
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:54,370
Hanawa's defense is weak now.

224
00:08:55,050 --> 00:08:56,260
Okay, got it.

225
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,930
Time for a counter-attack!

226
00:08:57,930 --> 00:08:59,760
This is bad, fall back!

227
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:05,560
Tsubasa clears the ball!

228
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:08,400
He's quickly advancing to the opposite side!

229
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:10,400
Alright! Keep going, Tsubasa!

230
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:13,900
I have to use this chance Ishizaki created for us.

231
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,560
We need to get back!

232
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,200
Yes!

233
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:16,950
Izawa!

234
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:19,530
Tsubasa passes to Izawa.

235
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:22,410
And keeps advancing.

236
00:09:22,410 --> 00:09:24,540
Hanawa runs back as fast as they can,

237
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:26,670
but their defense is in total disarray!

238
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,130
Tsubasa!

239
00:09:28,130 --> 00:09:29,880
Izawa sends the ball back to the middle!

240
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:34,400
Is this a shooting chance?!

241
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:37,510
He's close enough for Tsubasa to take a long shot.

242
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,510
Another Drive Shot?

243
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,510
Drive Shot

244
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,350
But if I fail,

245
00:09:42,350 --> 00:09:45,310
Ishizaki's effort will mean nothing.

246
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:48,560
I don't care about my injury!

247
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:50,370
I'll go through the middle!

248
00:09:50,370 --> 00:09:53,070
Tsubasa isn't shooting!

249
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:55,320
He's charging towards the goal.

250
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,320
Tsubasa-kun!

251
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,570
What is he doing...?

252
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:58,280
Stop him!

253
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,320
We'll crush him!

254
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,820
I'm up against three.

255
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,900
Tsubasa keeps the ball.

256
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:07,790
Can he get past all of them?!

257
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,170
Okay, I got this.

258
00:10:11,170 --> 00:10:12,160
A fourth?

259
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:12,920
Damn it!

260
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:15,850
When it comes to fighting spirit, Hanawa won't lose!

261
00:10:15,850 --> 00:10:18,260
Aimoto stops his opponent with his shoulder.

262
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,680
Tsubasa loses his balance for the first time!

263
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,060
Okay, I got the ball.

264
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,430
As if I'll give it to you!

265
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:25,850
What?!

266
00:10:28,790 --> 00:10:29,650
My shoulder...

267
00:10:30,070 --> 00:10:30,860
Alright.

268
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:32,940
Hanawa's goalkeeper runs out to save the ball!

269
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:34,610
Good decision!

270
00:10:34,610 --> 00:10:37,090
Kazuo! We'll protect the goal!

271
00:10:37,090 --> 00:10:37,990
Okay!

272
00:10:37,990 --> 00:10:39,540
Pain is nothing!

273
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:43,990
As captain, I can't afford to do less than Ishizaki!

274
00:10:44,490 --> 00:10:47,020
The goalkeeper was a second too late!

275
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:49,250
A sliding shot from Tsubasa!

276
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:51,450
The ball is heading towards the open goal.

277
00:10:51,450 --> 00:10:52,380
This time, it's in!

278
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,630
Not yet!

279
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:56,630
Go!

280
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:01,210
Hanawa tries to stop it with the
Tachibana twins' Skylab Hurricane.

281
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:01,210
Skylab Hurricane

282
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:03,850
Do they still have that much power left in their legs?

283
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:05,930
I'll stop it!

284
00:11:05,930 --> 00:11:06,850
What?!

285
00:11:09,230 --> 00:11:12,480
Tsubasa's shot pierced the back of the net like a knife!

286
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,090
Nankatsu takes the lead!

287
00:11:14,090 --> 00:11:15,610
3-2!

288
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:17,860
It's in!

289
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:19,100
Yes!

290
00:11:19,100 --> 00:11:20,360
Tsubasa senpai!

291
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,110
He did it!

292
00:11:22,110 --> 00:11:23,110
You did it!

293
00:11:23,110 --> 00:11:25,320
That's our Captain Tsubasa!

294
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:27,240
He scores when he needs to.

295
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:30,420
That little fool pushed himself too hard.

296
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:33,250
Now I'm going to have to treat him from scratch.

297
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:37,500
Damn it! Just a little more, and I would have made it...

298
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:40,680
The Tachibana Twins are devastated!

299
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,380
Hanawa MS is devastated!

300
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:46,390
The final whistle blows.

301
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:48,070
We did it! We won!

302
00:11:48,070 --> 00:11:50,140
The third game is over!

303
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:53,740
Nankatsu is the first team to advance to the quarter-finals.

304
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:55,930
We... lost.

305
00:11:56,650 --> 00:12:01,030
After all is said and done, it had to be Nankatsu, you know.

306
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:05,060
Still, it was a very exciting, hard-fought match.

307
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:06,570
Hanawa fought bravely.

308
00:12:06,570 --> 00:12:09,330
The spectators sent them off with a resounding applause.

309
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,890
It could have been an easy final match.

310
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:15,330
It was the best third match played so far.

311
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:19,400
I don't care if it's close or easy for you...

312
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:22,840
Keep winning until the finals, Tsubasa.

313
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:26,600
When the time comes, I'll crush you!

314
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:30,980
Hey, Hyuga!

315
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:32,980
Matsuyama?

316
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:42,990
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

317
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:45,490
INFIRMARY

318
00:12:44,210 --> 00:12:49,690
I told you not to make close contact, yet you did!

319
00:12:50,770 --> 00:12:53,960
But football and injuries go hand in hand.

320
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,000
It hurts, oww, oww...

321
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,630
Are you okay, Tsubasa-kun?

322
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:57,610
Senpai...

323
00:12:57,610 --> 00:12:58,250
Does it hurt?

324
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:59,350
Tsubasa?

325
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:02,060
Damn it!

326
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:04,120
Why? Why only Tsubasa?

327
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,930
I'm injured too, you know?!

328
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:07,420
Yeah, that's right!

329
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:09,220
We totally forgot.

330
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:10,160
Izawa!

331
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,010
Just kidding, just kidding!

332
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:19,170
How's your shoulder, Tsubasa?

333
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:20,520
Tachibana Twins!

334
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,940
Tachibana-kun.

335
00:13:21,940 --> 00:13:23,880
I don't know what to say...

336
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:26,350
Sorry. It's because of me...

337
00:13:26,350 --> 00:13:28,700
It's fine. It was an accident, after all.

338
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:31,200
Anyway, thanks for checking on me.

339
00:13:32,630 --> 00:13:35,630
Yeah, good job, chimp!

340
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:37,680
We lost to you!

341
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:39,580
The "chimp" part was unnecessary!

342
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:42,050
Damn it! Every single one of you...

343
00:13:42,050 --> 00:13:44,320
Make sure you do your part.

344
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,530
If you lose, we won't forgive you!

345
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:48,050
You can count on us.

346
00:13:48,050 --> 00:13:50,130
We'll make sure we win.

347
00:13:54,770 --> 00:13:57,300
So, you're not injured?

348
00:13:57,300 --> 00:14:00,150
Yeah. It's not an injury or anything.

349
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:02,780
Then why aren't you playing in any matches?

350
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:06,570
It's none of your business.

351
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:08,250
It is my business!

352
00:14:08,250 --> 00:14:10,490
I still owe you.

353
00:14:10,490 --> 00:14:16,930
Or did you forget I told you
I'd pay you back in a match?

354
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,170
Bringing up such an old story...

355
00:14:20,170 --> 00:14:22,860
Anyway... We, Furano, will defeat Tsubasa

356
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:25,540
and we plan to overturn you in the finals.

357
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:29,180
I don't know what happened, but you'd better play in the final.

358
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:34,400
That's all I have to say. See you.

359
00:14:39,850 --> 00:14:42,860
Alright, everyone. Get on the bus.

360
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,960
Ah, Hyuga!

361
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,610
Hyuga?

362
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:53,630
Hey, Hyuga! What the hell are you doing here?

363
00:14:53,630 --> 00:14:55,630
Didn't you play in today's match?

364
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:58,960
Don't underestimate us just because Toho is a strong team!

365
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:03,340
Don't worry, I'll be there in the finals.

366
00:15:03,340 --> 00:15:05,960
So it's not an injury then, is it, Hyuga-kun?

367
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:07,970
Correct.

368
00:15:07,970 --> 00:15:10,530
Then let's have another Nankatsu vs. Toho showdown

369
00:15:10,530 --> 00:15:13,100
in the finals for the third consecutive time.

370
00:15:16,970 --> 00:15:20,900
You'd better make sure you're in form by the finals!

371
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:23,190
Otherwise, crushing you will be meaningless!

372
00:15:32,310 --> 00:15:34,060
The match is over!

373
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:35,410
3-0!

374
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:38,160
Tokyo's representatives, Toho Academy,

375
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:42,170
defeated Gifu's Myoko MS and secured their place in the top eight!

376
00:15:42,170 --> 00:15:45,170
I did it, Hyuga-san.

377
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,780
Here, send it!

378
00:15:53,780 --> 00:15:55,260
Ah, big brother!

379
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:56,090
Hey!

380
00:15:56,090 --> 00:15:57,190
Good evening!

381
00:15:57,190 --> 00:15:59,100
That's your friend, isn't it?

382
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:00,980
He's been playing with us for a while!

383
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:02,550
Why are you here?

384
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:05,570
Did you come all this way just to see my dirty house?

385
00:16:05,570 --> 00:16:07,860
You didn't play today, did you?

386
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,310
I heard some things from your mom.

387
00:16:11,310 --> 00:16:12,810
What's the meaning of this?

388
00:16:12,810 --> 00:16:15,400
By not playing in matches, then saying
you'll quit Toho afterward...

389
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,080
Get to the point. What do you want?

390
00:16:18,070 --> 00:16:19,670
I will then.

391
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:22,010
I just came to do one thing.

392
00:16:22,010 --> 00:16:26,080
You defeated us and became the Tokyo representatives, Musashi.

393
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:31,010
I don't want the Tokyo representatives to put on a terrible show

394
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:34,340
and get defeated by some no-name team while you're absent.

395
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:35,970
That's all.

396
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:44,850
If that's all, you're free to go home.

397
00:16:44,850 --> 00:16:46,610
Big brother...

398
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:48,940
Let's go.

399
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:49,540
Huh?

400
00:16:49,540 --> 00:16:50,610
Okay.

401
00:16:53,110 --> 00:16:56,240
I'm relieved to see your condition and health seem fine.

402
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:58,730
It doesn't look like it's due to injury.

403
00:16:58,730 --> 00:17:01,580
You're the only one who can defeat Tsubasa.

404
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:04,610
I'm looking forward to the final match.

405
00:17:04,610 --> 00:17:05,400
See you later, okay?

406
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,220
Of course.

407
00:17:08,850 --> 00:17:09,770
Tch...

408
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,890
All of them...

409
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:15,680
Worrying unnecessarily about someone like me...

410
00:17:17,430 --> 00:17:18,300
Big brother!

411
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:18,950
Stay back!

412
00:17:18,950 --> 00:17:19,970
Huh?

413
00:17:19,970 --> 00:17:22,350
Don't come here, Takeru!

414
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:25,790
Just watch. I'll play.

415
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:29,190
I will definitely play and win it all!

416
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:36,070
On the fifth day of the tournament,

417
00:17:36,070 --> 00:17:40,830
the battle among the top eight teams
in the quarter-finals ended this morning.

418
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:45,630
Nankatsu MS from Shizuoka, Hirado MS from Nagasaki,

419
00:17:45,630 --> 00:17:47,980
and Minamiuwa MS from Ehime - Furano MS from Hokkaido

420
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:53,430
will have their respective matches in block A.

421
00:17:53,430 --> 00:17:57,720
Toho Academy from Tokyo, Chubu MS from Nagano,

422
00:17:57,720 --> 00:18:02,620
and Meiwa Higashi from Saitama, Kanamura MS from Miyazaki

423
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:05,350
will have their respective matches in block B.

424
00:18:15,810 --> 00:18:16,240
Huh?

425
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:17,860
Hyuga-san!

426
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:18,950
Captain!

427
00:18:18,950 --> 00:18:21,700
Coach, starting today, I'll take my place on the bench again.

428
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:22,810
Oh!

429
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:26,330
Hah, you're as selfish as ever.

430
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:30,060
Your acceptance as a player was made before the tournament.

431
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:31,960
I don't care if you're on the bench, but...

432
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:34,000
I won't let you enter the game.

433
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,260
Oh...

434
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:38,090
If you want to win, you have to let me play.

435
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:46,850
The match ends here.

436
00:18:46,850 --> 00:18:51,610
The first match of the quarter-finals,
Meiwa Higashi, the representative of Saitama,

437
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:56,110
defeated Miyazaki's Kanamura MS 2-0
and secured their place in the top four!

438
00:18:56,110 --> 00:18:58,560
They are the first team to advance to the semi-finals!

439
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,610
So first is Meiwa Higashi.

440
00:19:00,610 --> 00:19:03,170
The tournament is nearing its end, isn't it?

441
00:19:03,170 --> 00:19:08,870
Yes. The selection process for the 24 candidates
for the Selection Team has become quite interesting.

442
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:12,820
In this tournament, I will select Japan's
24 strongest young players

443
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:16,630
and start by taking them to a training camp.

444
00:19:16,630 --> 00:19:22,340
After that, a trip to the main stage, Europe, awaits them.

445
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:25,230
Okay! Now let's take a look at your left leg.

446
00:19:25,230 --> 00:19:26,100
Eh?

447
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,350
You can't fool these old eyes, kid.

448
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:32,230
Not just your shoulder. Your left leg is injured too, isn't it?

449
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:33,910
But I already...

450
00:19:33,910 --> 00:19:35,730
It's fine, just show me.

451
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:39,110
What's this? You've already bandaged it?

452
00:19:39,110 --> 00:19:40,240
Yes.

453
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:43,560
These are good bandaging skills.

454
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,990
Did the manager girl do it?

455
00:19:45,990 --> 00:19:48,610
Well... Yes...

456
00:19:48,610 --> 00:19:50,970
What's with that answer?

457
00:19:50,970 --> 00:19:51,500
What—

458
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:52,250
Ouch!

459
00:19:52,250 --> 00:19:56,130
Are you embarrassed? It must be nice to be young!

460
00:19:58,130 --> 00:20:00,920
So the next game is between Toho and Chubu.

461
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,800
Hey, Yukari!

462
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:05,800
Hirado MS's Jito!

463
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:09,560
I'm glad you've managed to win somehow so far.

464
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:11,820
What about that smug and arrogant behavior?

465
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:15,060
You barely made it by one goal difference, Hiroshi-kun!

466
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:17,440
Ah? Is that so?

467
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,320
What—

468
00:20:20,070 --> 00:20:24,000
We are here especially to play against you, Nankatsu.

469
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,200
We really don't care about the other matches.

470
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,410
What did you just say?

471
00:20:27,410 --> 00:20:30,850
It's not pleasant to defeat the team my cousin is in,

472
00:20:30,850 --> 00:20:34,290
but Nankatsu's winning streak will end here, you know.

473
00:20:34,290 --> 00:20:38,670
After our match today, your legend will crumble and fall.

474
00:20:38,670 --> 00:20:39,810
What?

475
00:20:39,810 --> 00:20:42,300
Well, we'll see about that.

476
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,510
Tsubasa!

477
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:53,210
Oh, isn't that Nankatsu's captain, Tsubasa Ozora!

478
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:56,770
Let's aim for victory and do our best today, you know.

479
00:20:57,310 --> 00:21:00,410
I'm the captain of Hirado MS, Hiroshi Jito, you know.

480
00:21:00,410 --> 00:21:01,560
Nice to meet you.

481
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:02,440
Pleasure's mine.

482
00:21:10,410 --> 00:21:13,000
Seriously, I'm really glad to meet you, you know.

483
00:21:22,010 --> 00:21:22,760
Hyuga!

484
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,130
Kojiro Hyuga!

485
00:21:24,130 --> 00:21:24,880
Ha...

486
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:26,260
Hyuga-kun!

487
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:29,300
Hey, it's Hyuga!

488
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:30,260
Hyuga is there!

489
00:21:30,260 --> 00:21:32,020
So he'll play today.

490
00:21:32,020 --> 00:21:33,780
Hyuga is on the field.

491
00:21:33,780 --> 00:21:35,730
So Hyuga will finally play.

492
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,690
Hyuga-san!

493
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:44,610
I don't care if you said you won't let me play.

494
00:21:44,610 --> 00:21:47,100
However, if you don't use me in the final,

495
00:21:47,100 --> 00:21:50,620
it's impossible for us to win against Nankatsu.

496
00:21:51,370 --> 00:21:55,540
For Toho's victory, what I have to do now is

497
00:21:55,540 --> 00:21:59,710
bring out the best in my teammates until the finals.

498
00:21:59,710 --> 00:22:02,960
That's something I have to do now!

499
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:09,140
Even though he didn't put much power into this shot,

500
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:11,680
it's much stronger than last year.

501
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:15,180
So Hyuga really isn't injured...

502
00:22:15,180 --> 00:22:20,020
I will definitely play in the finals!

503
